<title>NETHERLANDS: TOONDER GROUP RETURNS TO PROFIT IN FIRST HALF.</title>
<headline>TOONDER GROUP RETURNS TO PROFIT IN FIRST HALF.</headline>
<dateline>NEDERHOORST TEN BERG, Netherlands 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>All figures in millions of guilders</p>
<p>				First half 1997	 First half 1996</p>
<p>Turnover			    7.8			7.0</p>
<p>Operating profit		  0.5		 loss 0.3</p>
<p>Net profit			  0.5		 loss 0.6</p>
<p>Earnings per share (guilders) 1.68		loss 1.98</p>
<p>The audiovisual production company said it expected a</p>
<p>positive result for the whole of 1997. It added it would pay for</p>
<p>its acquisition of AV Media &amp; Technology BV by a private</p>
<p>placement of shares. -- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
